# n5 — the material chunk (mirrors demos/11-noita/n5-alchemy.bqn)
# 12x12 lattice, x the row (k div 12), y the column (k mod 12), registered like ex27 so the row-major convention wins.
# oil: a 3x3 pool (x 5-7, y 3-5) with a vein along x=6 out to the east edge; water: a pond x 9-10, y 3-8; no fire yet.
# moore: 8-stencil fibers, boundary shrunk, linear ids row*12+col, ascending.
# the payload: one firebolt row, pos in chunk coordinates — the anchor of the detonation's frame.
# blast: the frame predicate, per cell Fn ⟨cell, origin, r2⟩ with r2 the squared radius.
n 1
col pos vec 6 6
bind Firebolt entity 0
fn blast {c‿o‿r2: r2 ≥ +´×˜c-o}
